---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AdSlot from '../components/AdSlot';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Toolix"
  description="Learn about our privacy commitments and data handling policies."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 space-y-6">
    
    <div class="text-center space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Last updated: September 20, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card rounded-md p-6 space-y-5 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      
      <section class="space-y-1.5">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">1. Client Processing</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>Toolix</strong>, all file conversions, video trimming, PDF merging, audio extractions, and image compression are executed inside your web browser.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1.5">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">2. No File Data Collection</h2>
        <p>
          We do not store, inspect, transmit, or copy your files, metadata, documents, videos, photos, or extracted audio tracks.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1.5">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">3. Google AdSense & Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Toolix is a free service supported by online advertisements served by third-party advertising vendors, including Google AdSense.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>Third party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to website.</li>
          <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to your sites and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
          <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#FA9A85] underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-1.5">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">4. Analytics & Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          We may use anonymized standard web analytics to understand traffic volume and performance metrics.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

    <AdSlot client:only="solid-js" format="horizontal" />

  </div>
</Layout>
